{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Measure the bytes JSON mode actually writes**\n\nThe scheduler enforces `max_record_size_bytes` against compact JSON returned by `render()`, but JSON mode writes an indented representation. A record can pass or be truncated to the configured limit and still produce a larger file. Serialize compactly or make truncation measure the exact pretty-printed bytes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7uEtoH","finding_digest":"52fe803682f8a5331094f91887dbf1120a5135c344d04ef1eabb78691a2292fc","finding_id":"arf_v1_kl7ianuc7cstgeeu7emipw7rci","finding_key":"insight/exporters/file_exporter.py::fileexporter.export::json-size-limit","identity_key":"insight/exporters/file_exporter.py::fileexporter.export::json-size-limit","line":78,"observation_digest":"2831e394952e049e297a50a51c6fcdfc8da2de50edafa1236e61eadbeef5c077","observation_id":"aro_v1_fay6hfevfycj4kl2kcsry36n7s","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/exporters/file_exporter.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kl7ianuc7cstgeeu7emipw7rci","published_at":"2026-09-11T23:35:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gxyeexmt5x7z62mbqv3xknff2j","reviewed_base_sha":"8742ad9c9535e1de042963963c6b439f656894ce","reviewed_head_sha":"3a424e7bf6d3c768f38024007e42038eb43fcbde","reviewer":"codex","start_line":77,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":720},"record_id":"art_v1_nms2bl5wh74fgpkmub6xenjttt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T23:35:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
